-- ================= AoE4RPG Hero UI ===============
-- AoE4RPG Hero UI - Hero and Elite Presenter shows tracked hero and elite progression data.
-- Author: Hikitomi
-- Referenced: AoE4RPG_entity_tracker.scar, AoE4RPG_classes.scar, AoE4RPG_random_bonus.scar, and AoE4RPG_ui_panel.scar.
-- ================= AoE4RPG Hero UI ===============

if not AoE4RPG then
    AoE4RPG = {}
end

